            "kind": "source_inspection",
            "source_path": "src/analytics/indexer.ts",
            "line_start": 52,
            "line_end": 70,
            "observation": "重建逐项删除后回填，队列捕获错误，无候选快照原子切换。"
          },
          {
            "kind": "source_inspection",
            "source_path": "src/server/trust-fence.ts",
            "line_start": 21,
            "line_end": 39,
            "observation": "无Origin允许、Host名单检查不是身份认证。"
          },
          {
